      "path": "agent/lib/blob.ts",
      "content": "open(path, \"wx\") 成功后若 handle.writeFile 中途失败（ENOSPC/EIO/进程中断），半截文件会残留在 path 上。由于 write-once 契约正是靠 EEXIST 拦截同 key 重写，此后对同一 key 的所有 save_artifact 重试都会命中 EEXIST 而报 \"A document already exists\"——artifact id 由 (kind, title) 派生，重试必然同 key，只能人工清理 FACTORY_DATA_DIR 才能解锁；更糟的是 readDocument 会把这份截断的 Markdown 当作 found: true 的有效文档返回，下一 station 会静默消费损坏的交接 artifact。具体失效场景：磁盘写满时保存 artifact → writeFile 抛 ENOSPC → 工具返回 saved: false，模型重试永远失败，且下游读到截断内容。建议在 writeFile 失败路径上 best-effort unlink 残留文件后再重抛原始错误，使\"创建失败\"与\"已存在\"在重试时可区分。",
      "suggestion_code": "    try {\n      await handle.writeFile(contents, \"utf8\");\n    } catch (error) {\n      await handle.close().catch(() =\u003e {});\n      // A failed create must not permanently claim the write-once key:\n      // the leftover partial file would turn every retry into EEXIST and\n      // feed readers truncated content.\n      await unlink(path).catch(() =\u003e {});\n      throw error;\n    }\n    await handle.close();",
      "existing_code": "    try {\n      await handle.writeFile(contents, \"utf8\");\n    } finally {\n      await handle.close();\n    }",
